<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Lehman starts Axiom.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Lehman starts Axiom.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Monday it started coverage of Axiom Inc with a buy rating and a price target of $21 a share.</p>
<p>-- Company makes call &quot;data collection&quot; equipment.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Todd Koffman said the company will post its June quarter results after the market close today.</p>
</text>
